  },
  "constraints": [
    "Unique persona IDs, topic keys, episode IDs and world source IDs; exchange candidate keys unique.",
    "Entire request canonical digest: json.dumps(ensure_ascii=False,sort_keys=True,separators=(comma,colon),allow_nan=False), UTF8 SHA256.",
    "input_digest binds bytes-equivalent canonical frozen input; does not authenticate history, ownership or database state.",
    "All world source hashes are canonical digest(world); exchange source_hash is an opaque upstream binding, not recomputed from selected text.",
    "World occurred_at <= basis.as_of; withdrawal occurred_at < as_of and available_at <= as_of; compare aware instants, not string lexicography.",
    "Nonempty quotes <=240 characters must be exact contiguous source substrings; experience_quote must occur inside user_quote.",
    "Unknown/mixed outcomes produce no new positive/negative candidates. Withdrawal preserves target stance only for compatibility; it is not a new outcome.",
    "Product supplies only optional persona candidates, actual episode IDs and then-visible unwithdrawn withdrawal targets; it revalidates authoritative state.",
    "Timestamp format, semantic IDs, source hashes and source references are additionally checked in code. No text truncation."
  ]
}